meta {
  name: List the blocks of the home page
  type: http
  seq: 15
  tags: [
    Content
  ]
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v2/content/block/list
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "article_type": "homepage"
  }
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.timestamp: isDefined
  res.body.error: isDefined
  res.body.data: isDefined
  res.body.meta: isDefined
}

docs {
  Banner carousels and product sliders of the article of `article_type` (`homepage` by default — the home page; `slug` picks one of several articles), as edited in the storefront editor, in the order of the article: to build the home screen of an app. A slider comes with its products in the format of `stock/product/show` and the storefront address they are taken from (the «see all» link); a banner — with its pictures and link. Other editor blocks (text, HTML) are left out; for the whole page use `content/article/show`. An unknown `article_type` gives 422; a known type the site has no article of — `article_id: null` and no blocks.
}
